From: yifengling0 <yifengling0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 16:35:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 046/104] perf: reuse GL readback and SHM buffers

---
 dlls/winewayland.drv/opengl.c | 167 ++++++++++++++++++++++------------
 1 file changed, 110 insertions(+), 57 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dlls/winewayland.drv/opengl.c b/dlls/winewayland.drv/opengl.c
index e144ed114870..fff9aecfc9d2 100644
